+      + DECLARED_KB_PER_WRITE + ' KB per write (' + writes * DECLARED_KB_PER_WRITE + ' KB). The measurement on '
+      + 'this tree is ' + MEASURED_KB_PER_WRITE + ' KB per write over ten runs, which is 3.4x inside the '
+      + 'declared figure; '
